<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3970/75 Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7250/60 German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9388/93 Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4690/00 Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.57/58  Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8055/75   French Francs</p>
<p>		     1698.2/9.2  Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     125.35/45   Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.7061/35   Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.0438/88   Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5723/51   Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6240/50</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$341.70/20</p>
</text>
